  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Fantasia Pool</strong> is the main pool, between the Fantasia building and Cinema Hall. Official pages describe a Sorcerer Mickey fountain, with a smaller kiddie pool and a water play area nearby. Poolside activities are listed here on some days, and movies under the stars are a regular All-Star Movies offer.</li>
      <li><strong>Duck Pond Pool</strong> is the second pool, themed after The Mighty Ducks. Official pages list it at 105,438 gallons and describe it as a hockey-rink design. This is usually the quieter of the two.</li>
      <li>Towels are free at the pools. Hours and lifeguard coverage vary and can change.</li>
    </ul>
